; ..\BSW\ComM\ComM.c	  6593  \COUNTERMEASURE \S Verify that the value of ComSignalLength (byte) in Com module is smaller or equal to the value of COMM_PNC_SIGNAL_LENGTH (can be found in ComM_Cfg.h).
