; ..\BSW\ComM\ComM.c	  6597  \DESCRIPTION       Calling a function pointer defined in ComM_TransitionFctTable[].
; ..\BSW\ComM\ComM.c	  6598  \COUNTERMEASURE \R A runtime check ensures that array index never exceeds the size of ComM_TransitionFctTable[]. It is ensured by code inspection that the elements
; ..\BSW\ComM\ComM.c	  6599                     of ComM_TransitionFctTable[] are valid state transition functions and the size of the array is COMM_MAX_NUMBER_OF_STATES.
; ..\BSW\ComM\ComM.c	  6600  
