; ..\BSW\ComM\ComM.c	  6605                  \R A runtime check prevents dereferencing a NULL pointer.
; ..\BSW\ComM\ComM.c	  6606                  \R Qualified use-case CSL01 of ComStackLib because ComM_GetSizeOfUserModeNotiFunc() is used to check the array index.
